# SAEF belongs to the single AutoTest GitHub repository.
# Text engineering records, approved work products and evidence are versioned.
# The user explicitly authorized adding the two exact original schematic PDFs.
# Frozen firmware ZIP/source is managed separately after source/provenance review.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/engineering/
/engineering/*
!/engineering/control/
!/engineering/work-products/
!/engineering/decisions/
!/engineering/change-requests/
!/engineering/evidence/
!/engineering/assets/
/engineering/assets/*
!/engineering/assets/hardware/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.pdf
*.log
*.bin
*.hex
*.o
*.obj
*.pdb
# Exceptions only for the two approved original schematic assets.
!/engineering/assets/hardware/HW-MAIN-TestCtr-V1.5.pdf
!/engineering/assets/hardware/HW-KEY-EPB_ODD-V1.1.pdf
